From: Batocera Linux Team <batocera@batocera.linux>
Date: Wed, 6 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 8/8] build: skip runtime third-party libs for host tools

The host-tools-only configure only needs xenia-shader-cc and its shader
compiler dependencies. Return before runtime-only third-party libraries
such as SDL are configured.

---
 third_party/CMakeLists.txt | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/third_party/CMakeLists.txt b/third_party/CMakeLists.txt
--- a/third_party/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/third_party/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -341,6 +341,10 @@ if(XENIA_HOST_SHADER_CC)

 endif()

+if(XENIA_BUILD_HOST_TOOLS_ONLY)
+  return()
+endif()
+
